   {
    "id": "note-138",
    "type": "note",
    "x": 1580,
    "y": 134,
    "text": "How to read it",
    "color": "#b8925a",
    "size": 24
   },
   {
    "id": "note-139",
    "type": "note",
    "x": 1580,
    "y": 170,
    "text": "These are raw win rates. Players who pick an\noff-meta rune may be one-tricks, or picking it\ninto a matchup that was already hard, so a gap\nis a clue, not a cause.\nGreen or red only when the dot sits further from\nthe average than its whisker.",
    "color": "#e9dfc9",
    "size": 15
   },
   {
    "id": "note-140",
    "type": "note",
    "x": 1580,
    "y": 350,
    "text": "What it says",
    "color": "#b8925a",
    "size": 24
   },
   {
    "id": "note-141",
    "type": "note",
    "x": 1580,
    "y": 386,
    "text": "• Lethal Tempo is the default: 75.33% of\nEmerald+ · 26.20 games. It sits at or just above\nthe average because it is most of the average.\n• PTA: −2.1 pp vs Tempo in Emerald+ (2.5× its\nnoise), but only −1.0 pp in Diamond+ (0.9×). A\nlean against PTA, not a verdict.\n• Stormraider's Surge: −2.5 pp in Emerald+\n(3.4×), about even in Diamond+ (−0.3 pp). Higher\nranks pick it more (13.17% vs 10.01%), likely as\nan anti-dive pick.\n• First Strike: ≈252 Diamond+ games. Its\nwhiskers span ±6 pp, so it can't be ranked yet.\n• Emerald+ · 26.21 (new patch, early): only\n5,743 games. Comet and First Strike look great\nthere, but the whiskers say wait.",
    "color": "#e9dfc9",
    "size": 15
   },
   {
    "id": "note-142",
    "type": "note",
    "x": 1580,
    "y": 810,
    "text": "To test next",
    "color": "#b8925a",
    "size": 24
   },
   {
    "id": "note-143",
    "type": "note",
    "x": 1580,
    "y": 846,
    "text": "• Compare with coachless WPA, which adjusts for\npre-game win chance.\n• Split by matchup: does PTA or Stormraider win\nmore into tanks or dive?\n• Re-pull 26.21 once it has a full patch of\ngames.",
    "color": "#8f9a6e",
    "size": 15
   },
